<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 718)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>&#8220;Couldn&#8217;t encrypt a message&#8221; is gone.</b> It was never about encryption: one sync update held a number that wasn&#8217;t a number, and the whole update was dropped. That value now goes out as zero, the rest of the update arrives, and the app logs which kind it was.</li>
</ul>
